      <p class="cg-muted">Monitors Docker containers on Unraid with configurable health checks, dependency-aware recovery, and controlled restart protection.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cg-header-actions">
      <label class="cg-switch-row" title="Globally enable or pause automatic monitoring">
        <input id="cg-global-enabled" type="checkbox">
        <span>Monitoring enabled (save required)</span>
      </label>
      <span id="cg-save-status" class="cg-save-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading configuration…</span>
      <button id="cg-save" type="button" class="cg-btn cg-btn-primary">Save configuration (all containers)</button>
      <button id="cg-refresh" type="button" class="cg-btn">Refresh</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="cg-banner" class="cg-banner" hidden></div>

  <div class="cg-summary">
    <div class="cg-summary-card"><span>Docker containers</span><strong id="cg-count-all">0</strong></div>
    <div class="cg-summary-card"><span>Running</span><strong id="cg-count-running">0</strong></div>
    <div class="cg-summary-card"><span>Monitored</span><strong id="cg-count-monitored">0</strong></div>
    <div class="cg-summary-card"><span>Needs attention</span><strong id="cg-count-alert">0</strong></div>
    <div class="cg-summary-card"><span>Daemon</span><strong id="cg-daemon-status">Unknown</strong></div>
